  "protocol_notes": [
    "fresh engine per thread config; previous engine unloaded via del + gc.collect() before the next build",
    "explicit untimed warmup synth precedes all timing; 'cold_first_synth' therefore excludes engine warmup by design",
    "intra-op threads only (torch.set_num_threads); inter-op pool left at library default; synthesis is serialized by the engine lock, so N threads = parallelism INSIDE ops, not concurrent requests",
    "RTF = wall / audio_seconds, <1.0 faster than real time",
    "TTFA has two flavors per sentence: full-synth upper bound and harness-side sentence-split chunk-1 streaming estimate (RUNTIME-01 design path)"
  ]
